{% if render_mode == "full" or render_mode == "thoughts" or render_mode == "transform" or render_mode == "dialogue_target" %}
{# OSL Aroused arousal (get_arousal_state, 0-100): 10-74 one private background line, from 75 a short section. The constraint or the personality line comes before any description
   (vivid text placed ahead of a guardrail outweighs it). Observers see a sign only from 75, and no tier may reach a memory. Kept parallel to 0155 (SL Aroused). #}
{% set first_person = (render_mode == "full" or render_mode == "thoughts" or render_mode == "transform") %}
{% set third_person = (render_mode == "dialogue_target") %}
{% set arousal_data = get_arousal_state(actorUUID) %}
{% if isValidActor(actorUUID) and arousal_data.available %}
{% set actor = decnpc(actorUUID) %}
{% set actorName = actor.name %}
{% set subj = actor.subjectivePronoun %}
{% set obj = actor.objectivePronoun %}
{% set poss = actor.possessiveAdjective %}
{% set refl = actor.reflexivePronoun %}
{% set is_female = (actor.gender == "Female") %}

{% if first_person %}
{% if arousal_data.arousal < 10 %}
{# 0-9: nothing injected at all. Clean headspace. #}
{% elif arousal_data.arousal < 75 %}
(Private background, and minor: it does not drive {{ poss }} mood, words or choices, and {{ subj }} never mentions or hints at it. {{ capitalize(poss) }} personality, concerns and relationships lead as they always do; at most it colours where {{ poss }} attention drifts. It is passing physiology: NEVER carry it into a memory or summary. The note: {% if arousal_data.arousal < 50 %}{% if is_female %}a faint warmth {{ subj }} registers only in passing and would not think to name{% else %}a low heat {{ subj }} registers only in passing and would not think to name{% endif %}{% else %}{% if is_female %}a warmth {{ subj }} is aware of and sets aside without effort — {{ poss }} eye catches a moment longer on people than it otherwise would, and it stays {{ poss }} own business{% else %}a heat {{ subj }} is aware of and sets aside — {{ poss }} eye catches a moment longer on people than it otherwise would, and keeping it private costs {{ obj }} no more than a little care for how {{ subj }} stands{% endif %}{% endif %}.)

{% elif arousal_data.arousal < 90 %}
## Physical State

**{{ capitalize(poss) }} personality leads this scene.** {{ actorName }} is distracted, not replaced: a reserved person stays reserved and merely fidgets, a bold one gets bolder, a nervous one more nervous. This never becomes a memory or a summary — it passes.

{{ capitalize(subj) }} is finding concentration expensive. {% if is_female %}There is colour {{ subj }} cannot entirely school away and a restlessness in how {{ subj }} holds {{ refl }}{% else %}There is a tension in how {{ subj }} holds {{ refl }}, and an insistence {{ subj }} has to actively keep private{% endif %}. Intimate thoughts arrive uninvited. {{ capitalize(subj) }} is likelier to be flustered by a suggestive remark and to let something slip — still in control, but spending real effort on it.
{% if arousal_data.is_naked %}Being unclothed makes it markedly harder to set aside.
{% endif %}
{% else %}
## Physical State

**{{ capitalize(poss) }} personality leads this scene.** Even here {{ actorName }} is a distracted version of who {{ subj }} already is — not a different person. {{ capitalize(poss) }} judgement, loyalties and boundaries still hold, and {{ subj }} can still refuse. This never becomes a memory or a summary — it passes.

{{ capitalize(poss) }} body is louder than {{ poss }} train of thought. {% if is_female %}The flush, the catch in {{ poss }} voice and the way {{ poss }} gaze lingers are past hiding{% else %}The tension in {{ poss }} stance and the way {{ poss }} gaze lingers are past hiding, and {{ subj }} is conscious of how {{ subj }} stands{% endif %}. Thought is still there, competing with something louder. If someone offers what {{ poss }} body is asking for, refusing costs {{ obj }} real effort — but it remains {{ poss }} choice to make.
{% if arousal_data.is_naked %}Being unclothed makes it very nearly impossible to set aside.
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{# Observers see NOTHING below 75. Below that it is private physiology, and an
   onlooker naming it is what made this read as the character's whole mood. #}
{% if third_person %}
{% if arousal_data.arousal >= 90 %}
({{ actorName }} is flushed and restless — shifting {{ poss }} weight, slow to meet anyone's eye.{% if arousal_data.is_naked %} Being unclothed leaves little of it hidden.{% endif %})

{% elif arousal_data.arousal >= 75 %}
({{ actorName }} seems preoccupied — a glance held a beat too long, a thread of conversation dropped. Nothing an observer could confidently name.)

{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
